    "sub_title": "展演空間設計概念",
    "sub_title_en": null,
    "sub_describe": "本課程藉由觀摩多類型商業展演個案，探討室內設計參與角色、整合方式、表現型態，以實作內化設計理論與實",
    "sub_describe_en": null
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "展演設計概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION OF EXHIBITION PLANNING AND CURATING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在向學生介紹策劃展演實務的基本概念。 課程將討論展覽設計的所有實作內容包括：研究、規劃和編程、經費、談判、展品運輸、安全保險、贊助、目錄製作和行銷等。 在課堂講課期間，學生將更深入地探討有關宣傳行銷和影響當代策展實務的議題。 學生將了解作為策展人在更遼闊的藝術世界環境中的職責。",
    "describe_eh": "The course is designed to introduce students to the concept of curatorial practice. Classes will discuss all practical aspects of exhibition-making, including research, planning and programming, loan, negotiation, transportation, security, sponsorship, catalogue production, and marketing.  During class lectures, students will study in more depth about issues and topics that continue to inform and influence the contemporary curatorial practice. The course positions the curator, their duties and activities within the larger art world context.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
